 "description": "This is the life the award-winning Aquila 42 Yacht power catamaran is made for: accessible luxury, effortless entertaining, and those special moments when intelligent design transforms ordinary boating into extraordinary living.\nWhat immediately impresses is its sense of space—the 21'0\" beam creates a platform that feels dramatically more spacious than vessels of similar length. The flybridge offers elevated views for gathering under open skies, while the generous bow seating creates a perfect retreat for relaxation.\nThe bright salon with full galley flows seamlessly to the aft cockpit, creating a natural gathering space. These three distinct alfresco entertainment areas provide perfect settings for everything from intimate moments to larger gatherings.\nMultiple interior configurations and an optional interior helm station for inclement weather complement the Category A ocean certification, giving you everything needed to explore new horizons with confidence.\nBecause out there, wonder awaits.",
